{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9b1dcb0cb02748e33f1946b052dad840db7d5bcff853d571c05752399ef88245",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe176c7d7536e2d7cb9ef506ccfde4a99b6b068d364e3b7e1417ecfc94034f8",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0968e473fef01967134101ba00104ee6b4bc491827f1d07b02efd44f44db90a7",
      "text": "我想大概是受了艺术祭的影响……\n在梦里，鲤鱼游向了天空。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22c37f58955cbe95c058dedc84a1185bbf090404215c159a4ef21ca2dac8495e",
      "text": "大概是因为那次体验很新鲜，所以印象深刻，\n才会一直出现在梦中吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c60dd6ab136858997ed5c37047c94eb5cc954be317c6e7bec288115b69bd49",
      "text": "因为那是个很棒的活动呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a74662ebc1205a41160f06422f5283c9a7bef96a7a152bbaa55dd1795feb644",
      "text": "是的。如果当时在场的观众与\n工作人员们也能有同感，那就再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab6a3f3f08e6e23bcc36bfd782affd6c7c95048cc18b5f104061e238762694f",
      "text": "绝不能办一场只有我自己感到满足的演唱会。\n必须不忘款待之心，继续精进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b8e85835dc4d8354160694c83c3eb880e4382dfb3ae712748dd0ed722a156de",
      "text": "九郎先生的这份心意\n已经传达到了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c3ca921a8175aa9ea600c9f77e6648cb980b152172901b2bf8228308b3c350",
      "text": "九郎先生的话\n一定做得到的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00961cb3f7b149dcd3ae7a55efff7dcdcaacc0034f315bea4745c99cfd7ad126",
      "text": "能听到您这么说，\n我果然还是安心了许多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:255ae54994455c461d960f3e89fe2e1beb2d2c9e94edb25a540b39648b99bcfa",
      "text": "我不会因这次成功而自满，今后也会继续精进。能否\n尽快同您商讨一下今后的日程安排呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:019kur_401_2_4_019_01_09_a:2_4_019_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fadccade6ea302058e2876a3e0d6daf3d09a5929cc58510067b71bb7296c2e0a",
      "text": "那么明天见，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
